        ['Blackwood', 'Ask any portrait one question. Best on Day 3: ask a portrait in the library corridor what it saw. It answers truthfully and is terrified: “A painted man, climbing out.”', 'The grandmother’s diary mentions “the painted man”. When the name Vale appears (Day 4), the Blackwood recognises the debt.'],
